<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5779] Incorrect mapping of smallint cassandra type.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5779</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Looks like we map Java SHORT types to Cassandra INT type.&lt;br/&gt;
This causes an exception if user uses Cassandra SMALLINT type:&lt;br/&gt;
CodecNotFoundException: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;smallint &amp;lt;-&amp;gt; java.lang.Integer&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; with Cassandra&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See discussion on userlist for details.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/CodecNotFoundException-smallint-lt-gt-java-lang-Integer-with-Cassandra-td14938.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/CodecNotFoundException-smallint-lt-gt-java-lang-Integer-with-Cassandra-td14938.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
